    - pick H in 5-6; create H x H bg canvas
    - place 3 non-overlapping monochromatic objects with distinct colors; call them sel_0 (leftmost), sel_1 (middle), sel_2 (rightmost) by bbox column order
    - for panel 0, sel_0 is object index 0; add 2 more distractor objects to its right (all 3 strictly column-separated)
