0026:     - The frame has an even-height and even-width empty interior.
0027:     - Exactly two one-pixel markers of different colors sit outside the frame.
0028: 
0029:     Rule:
0030:     - A marker in the northwest or southeast side of the frame center supplies the
0031:       main diagonal quadrants of the interior.
0032:     - A marker in the northeast or southwest side supplies the other two quadrants.
0033:     - Split the frame interior into row and column halves and fill each cell by
0034:       the diagonal class of its half-position.
0035: 
0036:     Key insight:
0037:     - The marker colors are not copied from their exact rows or columns; their
0038:       coarse position relative to the frame center selects one of the two diagonal
0039:       quadrant masks.
