0032:     - From the left panel copy its leftmost object, from the middle panel copy its middle object, and from the right panel copy its rightmost object.
0033: 
0034:     Key insight
0035:     - The separator bars create three aligned layers, and the panel's own left-to-right object order selects which object survives in the merged output.
0036:     """
